# From "Five Questions" (Wave III - Freedom, CD2-4). The tape precedes these
# with the settled Gateway Affirmation and then channel-restriction.gws --
# assumed done already when this is used. Five questions, asked once each,
# with room to wait for an answer rather than expecting one on cue.

@segment  five-questions
@title    Five Questions
@levels   F12
@duration ~5m

say From here, you'll ask five questions into this expanded awareness, and ask for help in receiving the answers.
pause 6
say The first question. Ask it, into the far reaches of your awareness: Who am I?
pause 15
say You'll remember the answer clearly, once you're back.
pause 6
say The second question. Where, and who, was I before I entered this physical being?
pause 15
say You'll remember and understand it, once you're back.
pause 6
say The third question. What is my purpose for this existence, in physical matter reality?
pause 15
say You'll remember the answer, once you're back.
pause 6
say The fourth question. What action can I now take, to best serve this purpose?
pause 15
say You'll remember and understand it, once you're back.
pause 6
say The fifth question. What is the content of the most important message I can receive and understand, at this point in my existence?
pause 18
say You'll receive full understanding of this one once you're fully awake, in physical matter reality.
pause 8
